@journey name=hl-stage-c1a2-part1 title="Half-Life c1a2 stage, part 1: from the elevator arrival, the hall grate and duct, the soda room barnacle, the lounge switch, the hall window, the flooded room vent, the shaft and the cover, ending with an @save beyond the cover" prologue=segment segment_row=18 max_ticks=60000
# Part 1 of c1a2 (about 12,000 ticks). Walkthrough order (Danny Cox ch.4): the lift, west to the hall, the wire kills headcrabs, the
# grate *74 in the hall's north wall (crowbar), the duct to the soda room (cover *75 at its end, the barnacle that hauls the scientist
# is clubbed from its tongue column), the lounge switch *152 (kills the hall wire and the fan), back to the hall, window *1 (crowbar
# swing then a ducked jump), a second window into the flooded room, vent *73 (three headcrabs come out), the ramped shaft past the fan
# room, the 16 wide N-S duct, cover *87 and the dark space behind it. Every long walk is a chain of closed-loop @hold legs from hlnav
# (--hull 3 for the crouched duct); the swings are `@swing ent=N` on the BSP entity index. The @save at the end writes
# tests/cards/c1a2-part1.mcd, which stage-c1a2-part2 loads. The map starts fresh after a load: the switch and the covers are rearmed.
map c1a2 next x
  @wait expr="i32(LOGIC_PLAYER_POS[2]) != 0" timeout=120
  60
  @checkpoint start
  @wait expr="i32(ENT_PHASE[30]) >= 4000" timeout=400
  @face 4000 right
  @hold f127 until y>=-800 timeout=100
  @face 1018 left
